root.innerHTML=`<div class="deadline-kpis"></div><section class="panel deadline-purchase-entry"><details><summary>+ Adicionar pedido comprado</summary><div class="deadline-pdf-import"><strong>Importar pedido do FoccoERP</strong><input type="file" data-purchase-pdf accept="application/pdf,.pdf"><button type="button" data-import-purchase-pdf>Importar PDF</button><span data-purchase-pdf-status></span></div><form data-purchase-form><div class="deadline-purchase-common"><label>Pedido de compra<input name="purchaseOrder" required></label><label>Contato / comprador<input name="contact"></label><label>Fornecedor<input name="supplier" required></label><label>Entrega prevista<input name="deliveryDate" type="date" required></label><label>Frete<input name="freight" placeholder="CIF, FOB..."></label><label>Observação<input name="notes"></label></div><div class="deadline-purchase-items"><strong>Itens do pedido</strong><div data-purchase-items></div><button type="button" data-add-purchase-item>+ Adicionar item</button><small>Um mesmo pedido pode ter vários itens. Cada item será acompanhado separadamente para entrega parcial, saldo e reprogramação.</small></div><button type="submit" data-purchase-save>Salvar pedido comprado</button><button type="button" data-cancel-purchase-edit hidden>Cancelar edição</button><p class="deadline-entry-message" role="status"></p></form></details></section><section class="panel deadline-report"><h3>📊 Relatório <small>Filtre antes de imprimir ou baixar</small></h3><div class="deadline-report-filters"><label>Empresa<select data-report-company><option value="">Todas</option><option value="Colafix">Colafix</option></select></label><label>Fornecedor<select data-report-supplier><option value="">Todos</option></select></label><label>Status<div class="deadline-multi" data-report-status-box><button type="button" data-report-status-toggle aria-expanded="false">Todos ▾</button><div class="deadline-multi-options" data-report-status-options hidden><label><input type="checkbox" data-report-status-all checked> Todos</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-report-status-value value="Aguardando entrega"> Aguardando entrega</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-report-status-value value="Parcial"> Parcial</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-report-status-value value="Entregue"> Entregue</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-report-status-value value="Cancelado"> Cancelado</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-report-status-value value="Atrasado"> Atrasado</label></div></div></label><label>Data inicial<input type="date" data-report-start></label><label>Data final<input type="date" data-report-end></label></div><div class="deadline-report-footer"><span data-report-count>0 registros</span><div><button type="button" data-report-print>🖨 Imprimir relatório</button><button type="button" data-report-excel>📊 Baixar Excel</button></div></div></section><section class="panel"><h3>Controle dos prazos</h3><p class="hint">Branco: prazo normal · Vermelho: atrasado · Verde: entregue. Entrega parcial continua pendente até o saldo ser recebido.</p><div class="cement-filters"><label>Fornecedor<input data-supplier type="search" placeholder="Todos"></label><label>Status<select data-status><option value="">Todos</option><option value="Parcial">Parcial</option>${statuses.map(x=>'<option>'+x+'</option>').join('')}</select></label><label>Buscar<input data-search type="search" placeholder="Código, produto ou pedido"></label></div><div class="deadline-table"></div><p class="cement-message"></p></section>`;
